(one could also ask why the increments' distribution should be Gaussian,
 buuut no time to ponder on that now).
\end_layout

\end_deeper
\begin_layout Enumerate
On the other hand,
 if we believe that 
\begin_inset Formula $W_{t}$
\end_inset

 is a limit of distributions of random walks,
 what is unclear is 
\end_layout

